ans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">관한 법률</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">」 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">무단방치금지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">및 동법 시행령 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">조의 규정에 의하여 수거 처분하고자 하오니 자전거 소유자께서는 공고 완료 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 